<title>USA: Padre Dam MWD, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Padre Dam MWD, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $11.2 million of Padre Dam Municipal Water Dist, Calif., certificates of participation, 1996 water reclamation phase 1 expansion project, with a net interest cost of 5.51 percent.</p>
